"  approvedAmount",[405,613,484],{"class":415},[405,615,616],{"class":467}," optionalNonNegativeNumber",[405,618,471],{"class":422},[405,620,436],{"class":415},[405,622,623],{"class":432},"Approved amount",[405,625,436],{"class":415},[405,627,628],{"class":422},")\n",[405,630,632,635,637],{"class":407,"line":631},9,[405,633,634],{"class":415},"}",[405,636,499],{"class":422},[405,638,439],{"class":415},[281,640,641,642,644],{},"Add reusable format, length or range rules to the shared file; cross-field rules specific to one page stay in that form. Compose them with Valibot ",[285,643,541],{}," instead of building a separate validation config language.",[281,646,647,648,651,652,655,656,659,660,663,664,667,668,672],{},"File fields (",[285,649,650],{},"ShuoFile",") bind ",[285,653,654],{},"File | null",". Combine Valibot's ",[285,657,658],{},"v.file",", ",[285,661,662],{},"v.mimeType"," and ",[285,665,666],{},"v.maxSize"," for required, type and size checks; see ",[310,669,671],{"href":670},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fphone-file\u002Ffile#with-form-validation","With form validation"," on the File page.",[674,675,676,677,394],"note",{},"Dates and options are currently only checked for being required. Add rules for date formats, whether an option is still valid, cross-field conditions, numeric ranges and so on as needed, for example ",[285,678,679],{},"v.pipe(v.number(), v.minValue(1), v.maxValue(100))",[302,681,683],{"id":682},"empty-values-and-types","Empty values and types",[281,685,686,687,690,691,694,695,698,699,701,702,705,706,710,711,714,715,663,718,721,722,724],{},"Components write ",[285,688,689],{},"null"," \u002F ",[285,692,693],{},"undefined"," bound by the parent back as the agreed empty value (",[285,696,697],{},"''"," for text, ",[285,700,689],{}," for numbers, ",[285,703,704],{},"[]"," for date ranges and so on; see ",[310,707,709],{"href":708},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#empty-values","Empty values","). Unexpected values are cleared, and most components also log a ",[285,712,713],{},"console.warn"," (",[285,716,717],{},"ShuoSelectMenu",[285,719,720],{},"ShuoMonths"," only clear without warning; see the same section). An unselected radio group is ",[285,723,697],{},", so options should not use an empty string as their value.",[281,726,727,728,690,730,732,733,659,736,739],{},"The input types of the shared schemas accept ",[285,729,689],{},[285,731,693],{}," while editing, and the output after validation narrows to ",[285,734,735],{},"string",[285,737,738],{},"number"," or an array of the item type, so you do not need to change the components' empty-value contract.",[302,741,743],{"id":742},"display-and-interaction","Display and interaction",[745,746,747,755,773],"ul",{},[748,749,750,751,754],"li",{},"We recommend the built-in theme (",[285,752,753],{},"theme: true",") for error messages: a floating style inset in the field's bottom border that does not add to the field height. Keep enough spacing between fields, and avoid clipping overflowing content in the containers.",[748,756,757,760,761,764,765,768,769,772],{},[285,758,759],{},"UForm"," only fires ",[285,762,763],{},"@submit"," after validation passes; read the validated data from ",[285,766,767],{},"event.data",". When validation fails, ",[285,770,771],{},"@error"," fires.",[748,774,775,776,779],{},"Use the default validation timing on input, blur and change. When resetting, besides clearing the state, call the form's ",[285,777,778],{},"clear()"," to clear the errors.",[781,782,783],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki 